{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out, try a micro-ritual, or build a custom blend. Practical aromatherapy that may support everyday wellbeing." />
  <style>
    :root{
      --earth-1:#2f2b24; /* deep clay */
      --earth-2:#6b4f3b; /* warm brown */
      --accent:#c18f59; /* soft gold */
      --muted:#f5efe7; /* parchment */
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      --card:#fff9f2;
      --shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(47,43,36,0.12);
      --radius:14px;
      font-family: system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;
      color:var(--earth-1);
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--muted),#fff);}
    .pattern{
      position:fixed;inset:0;opacity:0.14;pointer-events:none;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-size:450px 450px;background-repeat:repeat;mix-blend-mode:multiply;}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:28px 36px;}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--earth-2),var(--accent));box-shadow:var(--shadow);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--card);font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin:0 10px;color:var(--earth-2);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    .container{max-width:1100px;margin:18px auto;padding:24px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:22px;align-items:start}
    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:20px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:28px;color:var(--earth-1)}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 18px 0;color:#6a584c}

    /* Blend builder */
    .blend-row{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    select,input[type=range]{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #eadfd1;background:white}
    button.btn{background:var(--earth-2);color:white;border:none;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer}
    button.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid #eadfd1;color:var(--earth-2)}
    .blend-output{margin-top:12px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(193,143,89,0.08),rgba(107,79,59,0.04))}
    .oil{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 6px}
    .muted{color:#7b6a60;font-size:13px}

    /* Form */
    form .row{display:flex;gap:8px}
    form input,form textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #eadfd1}
    textarea{min-height:120px}

    /* Modals */
    .overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(11,9,7,0.45);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
    .modal{width:520px;background:white;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.2)}
    .modal h3{margin:0 0 8px}
    .circle{width:140px;height:140px;border-radius:50%;margin:12px auto;background:conic-gradient(var(--accent),transparent 40%);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--earth-1)}

    /* FAQ */
    .faq dt{font-weight:700;margin-top:10px}
    .faq dd{margin:6px 0 12px 0;color:#6a584c}

    footer{padding:28px 36px;color:#6a584c;font-size:14px}

    @media (max-width:940px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;margin:0 16px}.modal{width:92%}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="pattern" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">AR</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:#7b6a60">Aromatherapy & mindful blends — in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="blends.html">Blends</a>
      <a href="shop.html">Boutique</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Tiers</a>
      <a href="about.html">Our Story</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book</a>
      <a href="contact.html" style="font-weight:800;color:var(--earth-2)">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <div class="grid">
      <section>
        <div class="card">
          <h1>Let's make a small plan</h1>
          <p class="lead">Reach out for a custom blend, ask about cohort programs, or try a short guided ritual right now. All scent work described here is non-medical and may support comfort, focus, or calm.</p>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
            <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <button class="ghost" id="openBreath">Try a quick ritual</button>
            <button class="ghost" id="openJournal">Guided micro-ritual</button>
          </div>

          <h3 style="margin-top:16px">Contact</h3>
          <form id="contactForm" class="row" onsubmit="return handleContact(event)">
            <div style="flex:1">
              <input type="text" id="name" placeholder="Your name" required />
            </div>
            <div style="flex:1">
              <input type="email" id="email" placeholder="Email" required />
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:8px">
              <textarea id="message" placeholder="Tell us what you’re after (custom blends, cohort interest, or a question)"></textarea>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px">
              <button class="btn" type="submit">Send message</button>
              <button type="button" class="ghost" onclick="resetForm()">Reset</button>
            </div>
            <div id="contactFeedback" style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--earth-2);font-weight:600"></div>
          </form>

        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:16px">
          <h3>Why connect here?</h3>
          <p class="muted">We run small cohort programs for practical scent practice (seasonal cycles, focus windows, evening rituals). If you’re curious about joining a cohort or commissioning a blend, this is the best place to start.</p>

          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <strong>Phone</strong>
            <div>{{PHONE}}</div>
            <strong style="margin-top:8px;display:block">Email</strong>
            <div>{{EMAIL}}</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Blend Builder</h3>
          <p class="muted">Choose a mood and a strength. The small recipe below is a starter; always patch test and follow the guide for safe dilution.</p>

          <label style="font-weight:700;margin-top:8px">Vibe</label>
          <select id="vibe">
            <option value="calm">Calm & Slow</option>
            <option value="uplift">Uplift & Brighten</option>
            <option value="focus">Focus & Ground</option>
            <option value="sleep">Ease to Sleep</option>
            <option value="ground">Grounding Ritual</option>
          </select>

          <label style="font-weight:700;margin-top:8px">Intensity</label>
          <select id="intensity">
            <option value="1">Gentle (0.5 - 1%)*</option>
            <option value="2" selected>Everyday (1 - 2%)*</option>
            <option value="3">Strong (2 - 3%)*</option>
          </select>

          <div style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px">
            <button class="btn" id="buildBlend">Create blend</button>
            <button class="ghost" id="copyBlend">Copy card</button>
          </div>

          <div id="blendCard" class="blend-output" aria-live="polite">
            <strong>Blend card will appear here.</strong>
            <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:6px">*Dilution ranges are suggested for adult topical use. See FAQ for safety notes.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:16px">
          <h3>Quick details</h3>
          <div class="muted">Cohort programs run seasonally and include guided scent practice, scent-making sessions, and group reflection. Pricing and schedule are shared when you inquire.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:16px">
          <h3>FAQ — Safety & notes</h3>
          <dl class="faq">
            <dt>Is this medical advice?</dt>
            <dd>No. Content here is informational and non-medical. Aromatherapy may support comfort or routine but is not a replacement for medical care.</dd>
            <dt>Dilution and patch tests</dt>
            <dd>Begin with a small dilution and patch test on inner forearm. Typical adult topical ranges are shown in the blend builder (0.5%–3%). For sensitive people, children, pregnant or nursing people, or pets in the home, use lower dilutions or avoid topical application. Consult a qualified provider for personal guidance.</dd>
            <dt>Pets</dt>
            <dd>Some essential oils can affect animals. Use diffusers and topical products cautiously; keep oils away from pets and their bedding. If unsure, avoid use around sensitive species.</dd>
            <dt>Pregnancy & medical conditions</dt>
            <dd>Some oils are not recommended during pregnancy or with certain medical conditions. Please seek personalised guidance from a knowledgeable practitioner before use.</dd>
          </dl>
        </div>

      </aside>
    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- Modals -->
  <div class="overlay" id="overlayBreath" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
    <div class="modal" role="document">
      <h3>Breath + Intention (2 min)</h3>
      <p class="muted">A short guided breath to settle. Use with a sitter aroma or a small inhaler if you like.</p>
      <div class="circle" id="breathCircle">Ready</div>
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:8px">
        <div id="breathLabel" style="font-weight:700">3 cycles · 40s each</div>
        <div style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center">
          <button class="btn" id="startBreath">Start</button>
          <button class="ghost" id="closeBreath">Close</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="overlay" id="overlayJournal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
    <div class="modal" role="document">
      <h3>Journal Pause (3–5 min)</h3>
      <p class="muted">A guided micro-ritual: breathe, reflect, note one intention.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:8px">
        <div id="journalStep">Step 1 of 3</div>
        <div id="journalPrompt" style="margin-top:10px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--glass);text-align:center">Ready to begin</div>
        <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center">
          <button class="btn" id="startJournal">Begin</button>
          <button class="ghost" id="closeJournal">Close</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <div class="container" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
      <div>
        <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
        <div class="muted">Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — cohort-based learning and custom blends.</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> · <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Contact form (no server) — local feedback
    function handleContact(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      var name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
      var email = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
      var msg = document.getElementById('message').value.trim();
      var out = document.getElementById('contactFeedback');
      out.textContent = 'Thanks, ' + (name||'friend') + '. We received your note and will reply to ' + (email||'your email') + '.';
      setTimeout(()=>out.textContent='',7000);
      // Here a real site would send to a server. This is local-only placeholder.
      return false;
    }
    function resetForm(){document.getElementById('contactForm').reset();document.getElementById('contactFeedback').textContent='';}

    // Blend builder data (informational only - not medical advice)
    var presets = {
      calm:[{name:'Lavender',pct:40,notes:'calming floral'},{name:'Sweet Orange',pct:20,notes:'soft citrus'},{name:'Chamomile',pct:20,notes:'gentle'} ,{name:'Carrier (jojoba)',pct:20,notes:'carrier oil'}],
      uplift:[{name:'Bergamot',pct:35,notes:'uplifting citrus'},{name:'Grapefruit',pct:25,notes:'bright'} ,{name:'Lavender',pct:15,notes:'balance'},{name:'Carrier (sweet almond)',pct:25,notes:'carrier oil'}],
      focus:[{name:'Rosemary',pct:35,notes:'clarity'},{name:'Cedarwood',pct:25,notes:'grounding'},{name:'Lemon',pct:15,notes:'fresh'} ,{name:'Carrier (grapeseed)',pct:25,notes:'carrier oil'}],
      sleep:[{name:'Lavender',pct:45,notes:'quieting'},{name:'Vetiver',pct:15,notes:'deep support'},{name:'Marjoram',pct:15,notes:'softening'},{name:'Carrier',pct:25,notes:'carrier oil'}],
      ground:[{name:'Patchouli',pct:30,notes:'earthy'},{name:'Frankincense',pct:25,notes:'center'},{name:'Cedarwood',pct:20,notes:'steady'},{name:'Carrier',pct:25,notes:'carrier oil'}]
    };

    function buildBlend(){
      var vibe = document.getElementById('vibe').value;
      var intensity = document.getElementById('intensity').value;
      var oils = presets[vibe].map(o=>Object.assign({},o));
      // Adjust aroma percentages slightly by intensity but keep carrier proportion
      var strengthMap = {1:0.6,2:1,3:1.35};
      var factor = strengthMap[intensity];
      // We'll compute recommended dilution for a 10ml bottle example
      var bottleMl = 10;
      var carrierPct = oils.find(o=>/carrier/i.test(o.name))?.pct || 25;
      var essentialTotalPct = 100 - carrierPct;
      var essentialMl = bottleMl * (essentialTotalPct/100);
      // suggested dilution percent label
      var dilutionLabel = intensity==1 ? '0.5%–1% suggested' : intensity==2 ? '1%–2% suggested' : '2%–3% suggested';
      // Calculate mL per oil
      var lines = oils.filter(o=>!/carrier/i.test(o.name)).map(o=>{
        var ml = Math.round((o.pct/essentialTotalPct) * essentialMl * factor * 100)/100;
        return {name:o.name,ml:ml,notes:o.notes,pct:o.pct};
      });
      var carrierMl = Math.round((carrierPct/100)*bottleMl*100)/100;
      // Build card text
      var card = document.createElement('div');
      card.innerHTML = '';
      var text = '';
      text += '<div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px">'+(vibe.charAt(0).toUpperCase()+vibe.slice(1))+' blend — 10ml starter</div>';
      text += '<div style="font-size:13px;color:#7b6a60;margin-bottom:8px">'+dilutionLabel+' • Patch test before topical use.</div>';
      text += '<div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px">Ingredients</div>';
      lines.forEach(function(l){
        text += '<div class="oil"><div>'+l.name+' <span class="muted">('+l.notes+')</span></div><div style="font-weight:800">'+l.ml+' ml</div></div>';
      });
      text += '<div class="oil" style="border-top:1px dashed #eadfd1;margin-top:8px;padding-top:8px"><div>Carrier</div><div style="font-weight:800">'+carrierMl+' ml</div></div>';
      text += '<div style="margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;color:#6a584c">Note: this recipe is a starting reference only and not a medical prescription. If pregnant, nursing, very young, or living with pets, consult a qualified advisor before topical application.</div>';

      document.getElementById('blendCard').innerHTML = text;
    }

    document.getElementById('buildBlend').addEventListener('click',function(){buildBlend();});

    // Copy blend card
    document.getElementById('copyBlend').addEventListener('click',function(){
      var el = document.getElementById('blendCard');
      var txt = el.innerText || el.textContent;
      navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText ? navigator.clipboard.writeText(txt).then(function(){alert('Blend copied to clipboard.')}) : alert('Copy not supported in this browser.');
    });

    // Guided breath modal
    var overlayBreath = document.getElementById('overlayBreath');
    var breathCircle = document.getElementById('breathCircle');
    var breathLabel = document.getElementById('breathLabel');
    var breathTimer;
    var cycle = 0;
    var cycles = 3;
    var phase = 0; // 0 inhale,1 hold,2 exhale
    var phaseDur = [4,4,4]; // seconds for a single mini-cycle

    document.getElementById('openBreath').addEventListener('click',function(){overlayBreath.style.display='flex';breathCircle.textContent='Ready';});
    document.getElementById('closeBreath').addEventListener('click',function(){overlayBreath.style.display='none';stopBreath();});

    document.getElementById('startBreath').addEventListener('click',function(){
      if(breathTimer){stopBreath();return}
      cycle=0;phase=0;startPhase();
    });
    function startPhase(){
      var totalSeconds = (phaseDur[0]+phaseDur[1]+phaseDur[2]) * cycles;
      breathLabel.textContent = cycles + ' cycles • ~' + Math.round(totalSeconds/1) + 's';
      updateCircle();
      breathTimer = setInterval(updatePhase,1000);
    }
    function updatePhase(){
      var secs = phaseDur[phase];
      // Use a simple countdown for each phase
      if(!breathCircle._t) breathCircle._t = secs;
      breathCircle.textContent = (phase==0?'Inhale':'Hold');
      breathCircle.style.transform = phase==0? 'scale(1.05)':'scale(0.95)';
      breathCircle._t--;
      if(breathCircle._t<=0){
        phase++;
        if(phase>2){
          cycle++;phase=0;
          if(cycle>=cycles){ stopBreath(); breathCircle.textContent='Done'; return; }
        }
        breathCircle._t = phaseDur[phase];
      }
    }
    function updateCircle(){ breathCircle.style.transition='transform 400ms ease'; }
    function stopBreath(){ clearInterval(breathTimer); breathTimer=null; breathCircle._t=0; }

    // Journal modal flow
    var overlayJournal = document.getElementById('overlayJournal');
    var journalPrompt = document.getElementById('journalPrompt');
    var journalStep = document.getElementById('journalStep');
    var journalIndex = 0;
    var journalPrompts = [
      {title:'Breathe 3 slow cycles',text:'Close your eyes. Inhale for 4, hold 4, exhale 6. Let the body settle.'},
      {title:'Notice',text:'Name one thing that feels okay right now. Small is fine.'},
      {title:'Set an intention',text:'Write one short intention for the next hour. Be kind to yourself.'}
    ];

    document.getElementById('openJournal').addEventListener('click',function(){overlayJournal.style.display='flex';journalIndex=0;renderJournal()});
    document.getElementById('closeJournal').addEventListener('click',function(){overlayJournal.style.display='none'});
    document.getElementById('startJournal').addEventListener('click',function(){advanceJournal()});

    function renderJournal(){
      journalStep.textContent = 'Step '+(journalIndex+1)+' of '+journalPrompts.length;
      journalPrompt.textContent = journalPrompts[journalIndex].title + '\n\n' + journalPrompts[journalIndex].text;
      if(journalIndex === journalPrompts.length-1){
        document.getElementById('startJournal').textContent = 'Finish';
      } else { document.getElementById('startJournal').textContent = 'Next'; }
    }
    function advanceJournal(){
      if(journalIndex < journalPrompts.length-1){ journalIndex++; renderJournal(); }
      else{ overlayJournal.style.display='none'; alert('Thanks for pausing. Small rituals may support steady attention.'); }
    }

    // Accessibility: close modals with escape
    document.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){ if(e.key==='Escape'){ overlayBreath.style.display='none'; overlayJournal.style.display='none'; }});

    // Initialize small default blend
    buildBlend();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page + usage notes for chunk 4

Files in this bundle:
- contact.html — The full contact page with blend builder and two guided micro-ritual modals (Breath + Intention, Journal Pause). This page is a self-contained static HTML file with inline CSS and JavaScript. It references an SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg for decorative background; ensure you include a unique pattern.svg there when assembling the full site.

How the daring features are implemented:
- Blend builder: select a vibe and intensity, then click Create blend. The script composes a 10ml starter card and suggests dilution ranges. All copy is safety-forward and non-medical. Copy-to-clipboard copies the readable card text.
- Two guided exercises (pure JS):
  - Breath + Intention modal: three short breath cycles, timed phases, visual circle and simple timing. Runs locally via setInterval.
  - Journal Pause modal: three-step journaling micro-ritual (breathe, notice, set intention). Step through with Next/Finish.

Placeholders used (must remain in templates):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Accessibility & safety notes:
- The page avoids medical claims and uses phrases like "may support" and "informational". FAQ includes dilution, patch testing, pets, and pregnancy notes.
- Contact form is local-only and gives client-side feedback. Hook the form to your backend if you need real submissions.

Integration tips:
- Add a unique assets/img/pattern.svg file for the decorative background. The design expects that path.
- Ensure other site pages (index.html, services.html, blends.html, shop.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html) exist at the same directory level so navigation links function.

Customization pointers:
- Adjust palette in the :root CSS variables for brand alignment.
- The blend builder uses example oil names and carrier approximations; replace or extend presets in the presets object in the script for your product roster.

Legal reminder:
- Content is for informational purposes only and not medical advice. Update legal copy and terms as needed for your location and practice.

